cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "CryptoVision: a reproducible cryptocurrency market analytics and research platform"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Venancio
    given-names: Caio
version: 1.0.0rc1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CaioVenxncio/cryptovision-dashboard"
abstract: >-
  An educational Python and Streamlit application for exploring cryptocurrency
  market data, building hash-verified historical datasets, computing descriptive
  analytics, and running a locally pre-specified study of return correlations in
  high- and low-volatility regimes. The study's validation gate failed, so its
  results are descriptive only. Not investment advice.
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - reproducibility
  - volatility
  - correlation
  - streamlit
